This package (Satisficing) incorporates code, documentation, and datasets from
the third-party R package 'careless'.

1. Ported Component Details
---------------------------
- Component Name: careless
- Upstream Version: 1.2.2
- Publication Date: 2023-10-01 (CRAN)
- Copyright Holder: (c) 2016 Richard Yentes
- Authors: Richard Yentes [cre, aut], Francisco Wilhelm [aut]
- Official CRAN URL: https://cloud.r-project.org/package=careless
- Upstream Source Repository: https://github.com/ryentes/careless
- License: MIT License (see file licenses/careless-MIT.txt in installed package,
  or inst/licenses/careless-MIT.txt in source tree)

2. Included Files and Adaptations
---------------------------------
- R Functions:
  - evenodd (from careless/R/evenodd.R)
  - irv (from careless/R/irv.R)
  - longstring and internal rle_string (from careless/R/longstring.R)
  - mahad (from careless/R/mahad.R)
  - psychant (from careless/R/psychant.R)
  - psychsyn, internal get_item_pairs, and syn_for_one (from careless/R/psychsyn.R)
  - psychsyn_critval (from careless/R/psychsyn_critval.R)
- Datasets:
  - careless_dataset (data/careless_dataset.rda)
  - careless_dataset2 (data/careless_dataset2.rda)
- Documentation:
  - Function and dataset Rd documentation adapted from careless package help files.

